            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I guess `FileType directory` wouldn't apply for zip/tar/etc, so even if it did work, we still need an answer for them, presumably.\r\n\r\nMaybe just need to tweak the name:  `NvimDirRender` is over-specific, maybe `DirRead`? it seems that `BufRead` is strongly analogous.",
