        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "usually i think it's a mistake to introduce events with Post/Pre suffixes, since that variant is always possible if a future variant is actually needed. (btw, `BufReadPost` is an alias to `BufRead`)\r\n\r\nbut in this case it might be helpful, to emphasize its order in the lifecycle. \r\n\r\n> this also works for zip/tar as it stands\r\n\r\nvery cool 🚀  . that's a hint that we're getting leverage out of the dir \"component\"...",
